		  Object {
		    $PropName		    "MaskObject"
		    $ObjectID		    38
		    $ClassName		    "Simulink.Mask"
		    Type		    "Data Adquisition Board"
		    Description		    "Performs analog filtering, signal conditioning and sampling. A single signal is the input, a b"
		    "uffer with the signal samples is the output. The options include analog filter enable/disable switch, type, orde"
